items.Nakasar_Fractal_Cursed_Treasure.name = Cursed treasure
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Cursed_Treasure.description = Crouch to pick it up; it stays in hand. The longer you carry it, the worse the curse. Right click: throw it to another player. Bring it to the siren's chest.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Cannon_Ripple.name = Ripple shot
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Cannon_Ripple.description = Right click at the cannon: three impacts bouncing along the line of fire.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Cannon_Scatter.name = Scatter shot
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Cannon_Scatter.description = Right click at the cannon: heavy damage and stun in a 4-block radius.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Cannon_Ice.name = Ice shot
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Cannon_Ice.description = Right click at the cannon: freezes foes in a 5-block radius.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Shadow_Cannon.name = Shadow cannon
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Shadow_Cannon.description = Use: man the cannon (or leave it). Its shots blow up mines and break defiance.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Reef_Mine.name = Mine
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Reef_Mine.description = It blows up when you come close.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Siren_Chest.name = Siren's chest
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Siren_Chest.description = Bring the cursed treasure here.
