intro = Captain Strohm: "Welcome to Siren's Reef. Arabella Crowe's crew still haunts the island: her treasure is cursed, and her ship waits for us in the cove to the north."
weyandt = Weyandt: "Saurians on the shore, and Stonehead in the clearing... we go through the ravine, captain?"
checkpoint = Checkpoint reached.
stonehead.enter = Stonehead growls: the clearing is his.
stonehead.pack = Stonehead calls his pack!
stonehead.flee = Stonehead roars, smashes the rocks and flees into the ravine!
stonehead.mine = A mine goes off under Stonehead! The ravine is mined: take the shadow cannon on the ledge.
stonehead.reset = Stonehead returns to his clearing.
cannon.manned = You man the cannon: right click with a shot to fire where you look. Use the cannon again, or walk away, to leave it.
cannon.left = You leave the cannon.
cannon.busy = Someone already mans this cannon.
cannon.reload = This shot is reloading.
cannon.miss = The shot is lost in the distance.
mine.cleared = A mine blows up under the shot.
wall2.open = The palisade is blown apart: the way to the fort is open.
fort.ghosts = Ghosts rise from the ruins of the fort!
peter.enter = Blasting Black Peter: "Who's tramplin' my mines? Boom!"
peter.mines = Black Peter scatters mines! Don't let him swallow them.
peter.powder = Black Peter swallows a mine: black powder! Break his defiance with the cannon.
peter.broken = Black Peter's defiance is broken: the powder scatters.
peter.ghosts = Black Peter calls the crew!
peter.cinders = Cinder Cyclone: get back into the fort!
peter.reset = Black Peter vanishes in the smoke.
peter.victory = Black Peter fizzles out like a wet fuse. The jungle gate opens.
head.open = The great stone head opens its mouth: the maze of cursed treasure.
treasure.intro = Three cursed treasures sleep in the maze. Bring them to the siren's chest by the exit. The curse grows while you carry them: pass them around!
treasure.crouch = Crouch to pick up the cursed treasure.
treasure.already = You already carry a treasure.
treasure.grab = The curse bites as you grab the treasure.
treasure.thrown = Treasure thrown: the curse eases.
treasure.caught = {name} throws you the cursed treasure!
treasure.cursed = The curse locks you in place: the treasure slips away!
treasure.deposit = Treasure delivered ({count}/{total}).
treasure.swindled = A ghostly swindler carries the treasure back to its hiding place!
orb.touch = The spectral orb bursts: ghosts rise!
maze.open = The last treasure is in the chest: the maze exit opens onto the cove.
cove.enter = The Kraken's Pride lies at anchor in the cove. Board it by the gangplank.
ship.south = Arabella's treasure lies on the south beach, guarded by her ghosts. Bring it to the deck's chest!
ship.north = Another treasure gleams on the north beach. To the deck's chest!
ship.jack = Mad Jack Squall: "Who touches the captain's loot? Overboard with ye!"
ship.calix = First Mate Calix: "The captain doesn't like thieves. Neither do I."
ship.defend = The ghost crew boards from both beaches! Hold the deck.
ship.progress = Ship defense: {count}/{total}.
ship.arabella = Captain Arabella Crowe: "My treasure, my ship, my reef. You're not leaving."
ship.ghosts = The ghost crew answers the call!
ship.drafts = Phantom drafts: get off the red strips or go overboard!
ship.fog = Fetid fog: get back aboard!
ship.water = The piranhas of the deep devour you: get out of the water!
ship.lagoon = Grim Lagoon: get out of the black water and pull the foes out of it.
ship.teeth = Teeth from the Deep: stack in the green circle to share the hit!
ship.leap = Arabella leaps to the other end of the deck!
ship.reset = The ghost crew fades away: the fight will resume when you return.
ship.victory = Arabella Crowe falls: the reef's treasure is yours.
title.victory = Siren's Reef complete
